<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">RANDOM PRACTICE</text><text class="title">把答案先留给自己</text><text class="desc">随机抽取一道题，先组织回答，再展开参考答案。</text></view><view class="section-title">选择范围</view><view class="all-option {{selectedCategory === '' ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectCategory" data-id=""><text>全部题库</text><text>随机探索所有方向</text></view><view class="category-list"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="category-option {{selectedCategory === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectCategory" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="icon" style="background: {{item.color}}">{{item.icon}}</view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="check">{{selectedCategory === item.id ? '✓' : ''}}</text></view></view><button class="start-button" bindtap="startPractice">开始抽题</button></view>
